# BidWise engineering rules

- Read `/CURSOR_HANDOFF.md`, `/README.md`, `/docs/IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md`, and `/AGENTS.md` before major changes.
- This is an existing hackathon project. Extend it; do not restart or replace its architecture without evidence.
- Preserve the complete safe-demo flow and truthful simulation labels.
- MongoDB must remain part of the executed flow.
- Validate requests, sessions and offers before persistence.
- Keep negotiation turns bounded.
- Use deterministic hard constraints and scoring for the winner.
- Keep exact transcript evidence references intact.
- Never let an AI or phone provider pay, book, contract, or invent offers.
- Never commit `.env.local`, keys, tokens or phone credentials.
- Run `npm test`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm run build` before declaring a change complete.
